<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan tenders for 9,000 tonnes palm oil -trade.</title>
<headline>Pakistan tenders for 9,000 tonnes palm oil -trade.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The state-run Trading Corporation of Pakistan (TCP) tendered on Monday for 9,000 tonnes of RBD palm oil for shipment in the first half of November, dealers said.</p>
<p>Bids are due to be opened at 0630 GMT on Tuesday. One dealer said the TCP would be buying the palm oil on behalf of the state-run Ghee Corporation of Pakistan.</p>
<p>-- Karachi newsroom 9221-5685192</p>
